# purpose: every rejection that exists at M2, and the precedence between them.
# exercises: unknown-account, account-exists, unsupported-currency, account-closed, account-frozen,
#            non-positive-amount, insufficient-funds, non-zero-balance; idempotent FREEZE/UNFREEZE
#            consume a sequence number; frozen permits BALANCE, UNFREEZE and CLOSE; closure is terminal.

OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob EUR
OPEN carol GBP
OPEN dave JPY
OPEN alice JPY
DEPOSIT alice 50
DEPOSIT bob 50
DEPOSIT carol 50

# --- frozen: what is refused and what is not
FREEZE bob
FREEZE bob
DEPOSIT bob 1
WITHDRAW bob 1
BALANCE bob
CLOSE bob
UNFREEZE bob
UNFREEZE bob
DEPOSIT bob 1
BALANCE bob

# --- precedence on one account: closed beats frozen beats non-positive beats insufficient
FREEZE carol
WITHDRAW carol 999
WITHDRAW carol -1
UNFREEZE carol
WITHDRAW carol -999
WITHDRAW carol 999
WITHDRAW carol 50
CLOSE carol
WITHDRAW carol -1
WITHDRAW carol 999
FREEZE carol
UNFREEZE carol
CLOSE carol
BALANCE carol
OPEN carol GBP
OPEN carol USD

# --- unknown beats everything
WITHDRAW erin -1
FREEZE erin
CLOSE erin
BALANCE erin

# --- closing needs exactly zero
CLOSE alice
WITHDRAW alice 49.99
CLOSE alice
WITHDRAW alice 0.01
CLOSE alice
BALANCE alice

# --- a frozen account can be closed if empty
FREEZE bob
CLOSE bob
WITHDRAW bob 51
BALANCE bob
CLOSE bob
BALANCE bob
